---
// Índice de previews do redesign — monocromático, Apple/Resend.
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <title>Previews · Redesign D.Lab</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,200;14..32,300;14..32,400;14..32,500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body {
        background: #000; color: #F5F5F7;
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 40px; padding: 40px;
      }
      h1 { font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 54px); letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
      .sub { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .26em; text-transform: uppercase;
             color: rgba(245,245,247,0.52); font-weight: 400; }
      .links { display: flex; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
      a.card {
        display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
        padding: 28px 34px; border: 1px solid rgba(245,245,247,0.16);
        border-radius: 14px; color: #F5F5F7; text-decoration: none;
        transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s, background .2s; min-width: 260px;
      }
      a.card:hover { border-color: rgba(245,245,247,0.5); transform: translateY(-3px); background: rgba(245,245,247,0.04); }
      a.card .t { font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
      a.card .d { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .04em; color: rgba(245,245,247,0.52); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="sub">D.Lab · Redesign monocromático · Apple / Resend</div>
    <h1>Variações do hero</h1>
    <div class="links">
      <a class="card" href="/preview/hero-a">
        <span class="t">Hero A</span>
        <span class="d">Keynote · centralizado, display fino, cinemático</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/preview/hero-b">
        <span class="t">Hero B</span>
        <span class="d">Resend Minimal · editorial à esquerda, hairlines</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
